# Schreier forest data for native trio transport

The table lists sorted mask triples and a forest rooted at four explicit
trios. Each nonroot stores a smaller depth, its parent, and one of the four
native sextet-stabilizing generators. The data alone asserts no coverage or
orbit theorem; the checked edge and injectivity certificates establish these.

Source: AS91 (3.8). Tables discovered in the supplied driver certificate.
-/
